# Mirrors core/rpm/indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers.spec -- same private prefix,
# same 9 vendor drivers, same scope decision (the ~50 other indi-3rdparty
# drivers that need no vendor blob are deliberately out of scope, STATUS.md).
# Read that spec's header comment for the full rationale; core/deb-
# 3rdparty-drivers/rules carries only the Debian-specific mechanics.
#
# Every Depends: on indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-<vendor> below is pinned to a
# LITERAL version (= X.Y.Z-1), not a substvar -- there is no dpkg
# mechanism for one source package's control file to reference another
# source package's version automatically the way ${binary:Version} does
# within a single source package. This is the Debian expression of the SAME
# hand-synchronized pinning core/rpm/indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers.spec's own
# `= %%{version}-%%{release}` BuildRequires uses (both specs' Version: fields
# are kept in step by the packager, not enforced by the build system) --
# update every line below by hand whenever -libs's own version changes.
#
# indi-stable-core-libs is NOT version-pinned, unlike the -libs Depends
# above -- core and indi-3rdparty are independent version axes (DESIGN.md),
# where -libs and -drivers share one axis and one tag.

Package: indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers-apogee
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, indi-stable-core-libs,
         indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-apogee (= 2.2.4.1-2)
Description: Apogee CCD/filter-wheel INDI drivers
 indi_apogee_ccd and indi_apogee_wheel, linked against the bundled Apogee
 SDK (indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-apogee).
 .
 This is an unofficial third-party build. It is not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the INDI project.

Package: indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers-asi
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, indi-stable-core-libs,
         indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-asi (= 2.2.4.1-2)
Description: ZWO Optics ASI camera/filter-wheel/focuser/rotator INDI drivers
 indi_asi_ccd, indi_asi_single_ccd, indi_asi_wheel, indi_asi_st4,
 indi_asi_focuser and indi_asi_rotator, linked against the bundled ZWO ASI
 SDK (indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-asi).
 .
 This is an unofficial third-party build. It is not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the INDI project.

Package: indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers-fli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, indi-stable-core-libs,
         indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-fli (= 2.2.4.1-2)
Description: Finger Lakes Instrumentation INDI drivers
 indi_fli_ccd, indi_fli_focus and indi_fli_wheel, linked against the bundled
 FLI SDK (indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-fli). Does NOT include the Kepler
 camera driver (indi_kepler_ccd) or its indi_flipro.xml -- both are gated
 by find_package(FLIPRO), which self-excludes here because
 indi-stable-3rdparty-libs deliberately does not package flipro/flialgo
 (still-undecided licence coverage, see STATUS.md).
 .
 This is an unofficial third-party build. It is not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the INDI project.

