Package: indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers-micam
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, indi-stable-core-libs,
         indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-micam (= 2.2.4.1-2)
Description: Moravian Instruments camera/filter-wheel INDI drivers
 indi_mi_ccd and indi_mi_sfw (plus their _usb/_eth symlinks), linked
 against the bundled Moravian SDK (indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-micam).
 Upstream's own driver source directory is named indi-mi; this package is
 named micam to match the sibling -libs package it Depends on.
 .
 This is an unofficial third-party build. It is not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the INDI project.

